comments.body:
It's a common closure scope problem caused by defining functions in loops.  The `index` variable is shared by all the parallel functions.

You'll have to capture it:

```
for(i=0; i < 3; i++){
  (function (index) 
    parallel.push(function(callback){
      console.log(index);
    });

  }(i));
}
```

or do something else:

```
var parallel = _.range(3).map(function (index) {
  return function (callback) {
    console.log(index);
  }
});
```
